# Horizontal lists nested in a vertical one: carousel drags and vertical flings.
route Nested
latency 250,700
wait 2
mark carousel-drag
repeat 4 pan 330 520 -260 0 250
wait 1.5
mark carousel-back
repeat 4 pan 80 520 260 0 250
wait 1.5
mark vertical-flings
repeat 5 pan 200 780 0 -600 120
wait 1.5
mark carousel-drag-deep
repeat 4 pan 330 400 -260 0 150
wait 1.5
statusbar
wait 2
